record, not clause 4. Copying the subject into the
log is still linear in the message. Raising K until
the copy fits would hide the finding. The line
before the MAC has to be a fixed size. A small model
can say that without a 4,000,000-byte state: the log
line's length equals the subject's, or it does not.

