no error, 32 initial states, 145,248 generated, 14,592
distinct, 17 deep. Your counts and mine, exactly, so the
draft's figure stands. Each of the 9 new witnesses violates
the invariant it names: P1Inv, P5Inv, P4Inv, P3Inv, P6Inv,
P8Inv, P9Inv, P11Inv and P12Inv. The 9 earlier witnesses
violate what they violated before.

