constant the other way the count is pinned, and the marks
that break are the ones named and no other. Between them
the 14 break all 13 marks. GateFresh is the 1 new constant
that breaks 2: a stale job let in runs past P1, and once
its record and the cache have gone it runs a second time
past P5. The freshness window is what bounds a replay.

