### Not verified in this pass

No live mailbox run: the sender experiments are local
serialization round trips, and a live restart mid-handshake
remains unproven, as do resumption over a live mailbox, a
2nd provider, and live scale beyond 1 session carrying 1
job. Resumption across a responder restart is not possible
